    "## 7. Create/Update Kaggle Dataset with Results\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why Dataset Instead of Output Tab**:\n",
    "- Output tab is glitchy and unreliable\n",
    "- Datasets are persistent and can be versioned\n",
    "- Easy to use results in future notebooks\n",
    "- Can be downloaded anytime from Kaggle UI\n",
    "\n",
    "**This cell will**:\n",
    "1. Create metadata for the results\n",
    "2. Initialize/update Kaggle Dataset\n",
    "3. Push results to your Kaggle Datasets\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset will be named**: `kl-vq-evaluation-results`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
